## AI / Human Collaboration

**AI does:** Code and tests inside SAO patterns, docstrings, catalog updates, refactoring.

**Human does:** Architecture beyond SAO, code review, Azure app registration, production deploy on LibreELEC, live Graph login.

**Escalate when:** requirements are ambiguous; a change needs a new SAO decision; work touches tokens, passwords, or bind addresses.

**Quality gates:** `make lint` → `make test` → Sphinx on public APIs → human review before merge.

