## Coding Conventions

Do not copy rule bodies here. Auto-loaded slugs that matter most:

- Commits: Angular (`do-follow-commit-convention`)
- Methods ≤ 30 lines (`do-write-concise-methods`); module-level imports
- Test-first pytest; no mocks in integration; log-story same commit
- Logging: `{logger} | {Class.method} | {beat} | key=value` — never secrets
- Skeletons + Sphinx examples before implementation
- Stack locks: `.cursor/rules/o365pop-stack-locks.mdc`

SAO §17 does not apply — no agent-lane conventions, no `assert_agent_story`, no `llm_scripts/`.

