## Running Locally

```bash
make provision          # Python 3.14 venv, deps, SQLite schema
make test               # pytest -m "not live_graph"
make test-unit          # pytest tests/unit/
make test-integration   # pytest tests/integration/
make test-log-story     # caplog beat proofs
make status             # CLI health (no HTTP server)
make login              # device-code Microsoft login
```

Copy `.env.example` to `.env`. Never commit `.env`, keys, or `*.sqlite3`.
